tyle=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">-&nbsp; 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래&nbsp; -</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">1. 신청기간 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;가. 학생 신청 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2012. 05. 31(목) ~ 06. 04(월) [5일간]</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;나. 지도교수 확인 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">2012. 05. 31(목) ~ 06. 04(월) [5일간]</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;다. 주임교수 승인 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">2012. 06. 05(화) ~ 06. 07(목) [3일간]</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">2. 신청</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">대상 : 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅) 석사과정 신입생</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">3. 신청방법 : 원스톱서비스 로그인→ 학사관리→논문지도→지도교수배정신청</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">지도교수배정 신청 후 반드시 지도교수와 유무선, 이메일로 연락하여 확인을 받으셔야 합니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2012. 05.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
